# Borderlands Solutions - Professional Junk Removal Website

A complete, professional website for Borderlands Solutions, a junk removal and light hauling company based in Lindale, Texas.

## Website Overview

This is a fully functional, professional-grade website designed for a real local service business. The site emphasizes credibility, trustworthiness, and conversion, with a clean, industrial aesthetic that reflects the nature of the junk removal industry.

## Files Included

- `index.html` - Homepage with hero section, services overview, and trust signals
- `services.html` - Detailed services page with comprehensive descriptions
- `areas.html` - Service areas page covering all East Texas communities
- `pricing.html` - Transparent pricing information page
- `about.html` - About page with company values and approach
- `contact.html` - Contact page with form and business information
- `styles.css` - Complete stylesheet with responsive design
- `script.js` - JavaScript for navigation and interactivity

## Features

### Design
- Professional, contractor-grade aesthetic
- Custom typography using Bebas Neue and Work Sans
- Grounded color palette (dark greens, grays, black, white)
- Fully responsive design for all devices
- Clean, no-nonsense layouts
- No emojis or playful elements

### Functionality
- Sticky navigation header
- Mobile-responsive hamburger menu
- Smooth scrolling
- Scroll-triggered animations
- Contact form ready for Formspree integration
- Click-to-call phone numbers
- SEO-friendly structure

### Content
- Clear service descriptions for all offerings
- Detailed service area coverage
- Transparent pricing information
- Professional about page
- Multiple call-to-action buttons throughout
- Trust signals and value propositions

## Setup Instructions

### 1. Basic Setup
Simply upload all files to your web hosting server. The website will work immediately as static HTML pages.

### 2. Contact Form Setup
The contact form is configured to use Formspree. To activate it:

1. Go to https://formspree.io and create a free account
2. Create a new form and get your form ID
3. Open `contact.html` in a text editor
4. Find the line: `<form action="https://formspree.io/f/YOUR_FORM_ID" method="POST">`
5. Replace `YOUR_FORM_ID` with your actual Formspree form ID
6. Save the file

### 3. Customization Options

#### Update Phone Number
The phone number 972-740-7232 appears throughout the site. To change it:
- Search and replace "972-740-7232" across all HTML files
- Also search and replace "9727407232" (the tel: link format)

#### Update Business Hours
Edit the business hours in `contact.html` under the "Business Hours" section.

#### Add Real Images
Replace the SVG placeholder images with actual photos:
- Service trucks
- Team members working
- Before/after shots of cleanouts
- Professional headshots

Recommended image locations:
- Hero section background (index.html)
- Service detail cards (services.html)
- About page (about.html)

#### Adjust Colors
Colors are defined as CSS variables in `styles.css`:
```css
:root {
    --color-primary: #1a2a1f;
    --color-secondary: #2a3a2f;
    --color-accent: #3d5a45;
    --color-light: #f5f5f3;
    --color-white: #ffffff;
}
```

### 4. SEO Optimization

#### Meta Tags
Each page includes basic meta tags. Consider adding:
- Open Graph tags for social media sharing
- Twitter Card tags
- Schema.org markup for local business

#### Google Analytics
Add your Google Analytics tracking code before the closing `</body>` tag on each page.

#### Google Search Console
Submit your sitemap to Google Search Console after going live.

### 5. Performance Optimization

#### Fonts
Currently using Google Fonts. For better performance:
- Consider self-hosting the fonts
- Or use system fonts for faster load times

#### Images
When adding real images:
- Optimize all images before upload (use tools like TinyPNG)
- Use WebP format when possible
- Add proper width/height attributes
- Implement lazy loading for below-fold images

